[{"id":"demo-http-cache","type":"cloze","priority":2,"deck":"HTTP 基础","tags":["缓存","响应头"],"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html","articles":[{"articleKey":"flashcard-demo/index.md","articleTitle":"闪卡插件效果预览","articlePath":"flashcard-demo/index.html"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 强缓存通常由 ＿＿＿＿ 响应头控制。\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Cache-Control\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>Cache-Control\u003c/code> 用来声明浏览器和中间缓存的缓存策略，例如：\u003c/p>\n\u003cpre>\u003ccode class=\"lang-http\">Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600\n\u003c/code>\u003c/pre>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>指令\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>含义\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>max-age\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>响应可复用的最长时间\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>no-cache\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>使用前必须重新验证\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]